Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:24.84,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 多伦多 WTA1000 第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:24.84,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}伊埃拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-3 5-7 6-4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 麦克纳莉 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.54,0:00:02.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, Alex is front end here in Toronto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.54,0:00:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯就在多伦多现场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:04.62,EN,,0,0,0,,and it is fever pitch atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:04.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,气氛简直沸腾了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:05.58,EN,,0,0,0,,The crowd delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:05.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,观众们也乐开了花
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:07.34,EN,,0,0,0,,You are through to the round of 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:07.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,你已经打进 1/8 决赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:10.58,EN,,0,0,0,,Well played.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,打得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.90,EN,,0,0,0,,A tough match for you this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场对你来说很艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:14.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Seem to be struggling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的左脚踝伤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:16.54,EN,,0,0,0,,with uh your left ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:16.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,好像一直在困扰你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:18.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Firstly, how are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:18.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在感觉怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.38,0:00:19.58,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.38,0:00:19.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:23.18,EN,,0,0,0,,I um yeah, I think I survived that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:23.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场我算是扛过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:26.82,EN,,0,0,0,,It was so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:26.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的太艰难了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:28.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:28.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:32.06,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, I want to thank Katie for a great match,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:32.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,想谢谢凯蒂 打了一场精彩比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.26,EN,,0,0,0,,being a great sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,她的风度也很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:35.02,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, it's one of those matches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:35.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是那种
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:38.22,EN,,0,0,0,,that really could have gone either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:38.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,谁赢都不奇怪的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:41.42,EN,,0,0,0,,I I think it was really down to details
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:41.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得最后拼的就是细节
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:42.70,EN,,0,0,0,,and a little bit of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:42.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有一点运气
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:45.50,EN,,0,0,0,,So, um, give her her flowers, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:45.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,把掌声也送给她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:49.38,EN,,0,0,0,,It was a really great match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:49.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的是一场精彩的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:52.78,EN,,0,0,0,,Clearly a tough win for that one,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:52.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,那一场确实赢得艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:55.50,EN,,0,0,0,,but it is your seventh win in a row
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:55.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,但这已经是你的第七连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:56.46,EN,,0,0,0,,and counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:56.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且还在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:57.98,EN,,0,0,0,,This is some real momentum you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:57.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在这股势头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:01:00.46,EN,,0,0,0,,building right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.98,0:01:00.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,是真的很猛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:03.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean these what like two weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:03.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 这两周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:06.54,EN,,0,0,0,,have been incredible for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:06.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:09.18,EN,,0,0,0,,just so many extreme emotions
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.54,0:01:09.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,情绪起伏特别大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.18,0:01:11.82,EN,,0,0,0,,and and I'm really I'm doing my best
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.18,0:01:11.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是真的在尽全力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:13.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to to power
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:13.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,想要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:16.38,EN,,0,0,0,,through and and be a professional
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:16.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,咬牙撑过去 保持职业
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:18.06,EN,,0,0,0,,and and do what I know how
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:18.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,做好该做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:20.22,EN,,0,0,0,,to do and I mean to play in front
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:20.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,能在你们面前打球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:22.14,EN,,0,0,0,,of you guys it's it's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:22.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很奇妙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:27.82,EN,,0,0,0,,So I mean the motivation to to come here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:27.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,想到能来这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.82,0:01:30.22,EN,,0,0,0,,and play another match like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.82,0:01:30.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,再打一场这样的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:32.38,EN,,0,0,0,,it everything just becomes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:32.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,一切都会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:38.02,EN,,0,0,0,,so much more emotional guys like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,变得更加动情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:41.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Like I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:41.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也说不好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:44.14,EN,,0,0,0,,someone in the crowd said like they wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:44.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,看台上有人说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.14,0:01:49.34,EN,,0,0,0,,to be Filipino for tonight and I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.14,0:01:49.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚想当一次菲律宾人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.34,0:01:52.70,EN,,0,0,0,,that I that stuck with me cuz actually I went
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.34,0:01:52.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,这句话一直留在我心里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.70,0:01:54.38,EN,,0,0,0,,to like a Bad Bunny concert
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.70,0:01:54.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我看过 Bad Bunny 演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:57.18,EN,,0,0,0,,and I felt Puerto Rican for that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:57.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,那晚我觉得自己是波多黎各人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:02:00.62,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I mean, for the Filipino community
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:02:00.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以对菲律宾社群来说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:02.22,EN,,0,0,0,,to also have that impact
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:02.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,能带来这样的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:03.98,EN,,0,0,0,,on on other people, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:03.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,对别的人也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.98,0:02:06.30,EN,,0,0,0,,the Canadians have been so hospitable
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.98,0:02:06.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,加拿大人对我特别友好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.30,0:02:06.86,EN,,0,0,0,,to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.30,0:02:06.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,待我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.86,0:02:08.86,EN,,0,0,0,,They've been amazing these past couple
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.86,0:02:08.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,这几天他们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:10.06,EN,,0,0,0,,of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直都很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:12.78,EN,,0,0,0,,So, um I really hope that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:12.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我也希望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.78,0:02:14.06,EN,,0,0,0,,the Canadians also get
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.78,0:02:14.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,加拿大人也能感受到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.06,0:02:17.58,EN,,0,0,0,,that feeling of hospit hospitality, sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.06,0:02:17.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种款待的感觉 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.58,0:02:18.62,EN,,0,0,0,,from the Filipinos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.58,0:02:18.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,来自菲律宾人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:19.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:19.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:21.10,EN,,0,0,0,,Listen, we're going to let you get some rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:21.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,好了 让你去休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:21.50,EN,,0,0,0,,folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:21.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:22.70,EN,,0,0,0,,But one last time this evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:22.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,但今晚最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:24.84,EN,,0,0,0,,give it up for Alexandra Eala.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:24.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,掌声送给伊埃拉
